  "description": "Lilac has one simple quest: to get a full-time job that lets her draw pictures for a living. When a graphics position opens at a video game company, she decides to go for it -- the problem is, she’s never played a video game in her life. Lilac boots up one of her brother’s old RPG games, but much to her surprise, the max-level character in the game pops out of the monitor! This wizard named Ryan is convinced that Lilac is the princess he must protect at all costs. Can Ryan help Lilac on her quest to navigate the dungeon (the game company) and defeat the monster (the company boss) to win a full-time job?\n\n**Official English Translations:**  \n[Tappytoon](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/living-with-wizard), [Renta!](https://www.ebookrenta.com/renta/sc/frm/item/146002)",
